{
    "title": "CodyCross: Crossword Puzzles",
    "description": "Are you tired of the same old board games - classic crossword and word puzzles?\r\nCodyCross is here to introduce you to a fun new spelling puzzle and trivia crossword game.\r\n\r\nStart your journey with CodyCross, a friendly alien from the planet COD-X who came to Earth to learn about our planet. Learn about interesting and fun facts as you play through the levels and encounter unique, themed crossword puzzles.\r\n\r\nCodyCross: Crossword Puzzle, is the ultimate crossword game for adults! An exciting trivia mobile app that combines the fun of crossword games with the challenge of improving your vocabulary and spelling skills. Access unlimited crossword puzzles that will test your knowledge and keep you entertained.\r\n\r\nBegin with a themed crossword puzzle board and try to guess the words that fit in the boxes, each with unique trivia clues, hints, and categories. Connect the letters you are guessing and solve the clues. All crosswords have a hidden secret word to help CodyCross attain more knowledge. Are you ready to enter this crossword universe? With crossword puzzles available daily, you'll never run out of new words and spelling challenges.\r\n\r\nLEARN WITH TRIVIA\r\nImprove your spelling as you solve each puzzle, with each correct answer you advance to the next level. Have fun and play spelling bee games that will help you improve your vocabulary and enhance your grammar skills. All crosswords have a hidden secret word to help Codycross learn more. It is a fun way to test your general knowledge and your spelling skills, especially if you're tired of playing Trivia Crack, NYT crossword, New York Times games, and other boring crossword games. On this adventure, you\u2019ll challenge yourself and expand your word knowledge.\r\n\r\nJOIN\r\nThe crossword community is already enjoying CodyCross. With its unique combination of word and spelling puzzles, it\u2019s the perfect mobile app game for anyone who loves puzzles and wants to improve their word skills. Whether you're a fan of crossword puzzles, spelling games, or word association, CodyCross has something for you. Become part of a community of players who want to learn and start solving trivia puzzles today.\r\n\r\nDISCOVER\r\nLooking for a fun and challenging way to improve your word and spelling skills? Well, look no further than CodyCross! Explore beautiful worlds with this crossword hobby. Each map has unique words, trivia clues, crossword puzzles, and scenarios. Expand your library with different books to build your collection and learn fun facts and curiosities. With its unique combination of themed crossword unlimited puzzles and spelling games.\r\n\r\nHAVE FUN\r\nCodycross is more fun and challenging than other word search puzzles and newspaper crossword games. Start playing now, enjoy crossword free unlimited, get rid of misspelled words, and join the fun with a crossword infinite puzzle game. With this categories game, you will test your general knowledge, expand your vocabulary, and enjoy an interactive word hobby. Keep your mind sharp with the different difficulty levels and play different game modes, such as Today\u2019s Password (Contexto, Puzzword, and Wordle fans love it) and daily themed crosswords. Show your skills with the Daily Streak and Trivia Word Missions.\r\n\r\nSUBSCRIPTION: THE ULTIMATE WAY TO PLAY CROSSWORD PUZZLES\r\n\r\n- No ads interrupting your crossword puzzle experience;\r\n- Crossword unlimited game with more prizes and rewards;\r\n- Unlimited crossword puzzle and spelling puzzle games;\r\n- Access to the entire Crossword Puzzle Free Daily games with words, spelling, and letters;\r\n\r\nCodyCross: Crossword Puzzle Free is a game from the creators of Stop, Word Lanes, and Everyday Puzzles. They\u2019re all puzzle games for teens and adults alike. Embark on this adventure with CodyCross! Solve the clues, guess the secret word, use your trivia knowledge and have fun!\r\n\r\nYou can read our privacy policy at https://game.codycross-game.com/Terms/PrivacyPolicy\r\nYou can read our terms of use at https://game.codycross-game.com/Terms/TermsOfService",
